<title>FINLAND: TULIKIVI SEES POSITIVE EARNINGS PROSPECTS.</title>
<headline>TULIKIVI SEES POSITIVE EARNINGS PROSPECTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish stone fireplace maker Tulikivi Oy said in a statement on Friday it expected earnings to develop favourably this year thanks to the domestic recovery in construction and positive European export prospects.</p>
</text>
